# Trivy vulnerability ignore list
# Format: one CVE ID per line, with justification below each entry.
# Scanned by ci.yml Trivy gate (severity: HIGH,CRITICAL, exit-code: 1).

# CVE-2025-47273 — setuptools: Path Traversal in PackageIndex (HIGH)
# Installed 70.3.0 ships inside the python:3.11-slim base image's Debian
# python3-setuptools system package (/usr/lib/python3/dist-packages).
# Debian 13 does not ship a fixed version, so it cannot be patched in-image.
# NOT exploitable in this service: setuptools is a build-time packaging tool;
# the runtime API (uvicorn/FastAPI + RAG pipeline) never imports setuptools
# or invokes PackageIndex. Re-evaluate if the base image updates.
CVE-2025-47273
